      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Slava REAPER Test Suite\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This metapackage installs four interactive ReaImGui test actions and their shared Lua modules. It is intended solely for testing ReaPack installation, update, and removal workflows.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Included actions\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b test_Curl_Jobs}: async HTTP operations and background-task scheduling.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b test_Files}: filesystem utilities, path manipulation, and sandbox I/O.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b test_docx}: DOCX extraction, XML parsing, and dialogue extraction.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b test_neurocast_auth}: Neurocast authentication-flow testing.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Platform support\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Windows x64} installs the actions, shared modules, bundled support files, and applicable notices.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b macOS} installs the actions, shared modules, and applicable notices; it uses {\f1 /usr/bin/curl} and the system {\f1 unzip}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Linux} has no installable sources.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Installation notes\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Requirements: REAPER 7.0+ and ReaImGui (available through ReaPack).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Install this one package from ReaPack, then find the four actions under {\f1 Slava-Testing} in REAPER's Actions list. Package license and notice files are installed in the package's {\f1 licenses} subdirectory.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Links\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Repository: https://github.com/Logutin/slava-reaper-reapack-test-curl-jobs-imgui\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab License and notices: https://github.com/Logutin/slava-reaper-reapack-test-curl-jobs-imgui/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md\sa180\par}
}
]]></description>
