{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Slava REAPER Test Suite\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Interactive test scripts for REAPER, built with ReaImGui and distributed as one ReaPack metapackage.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Included Tests\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b test_Curl_Jobs} \u8212- async HTTP operations and background task scheduling.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b test_Files} \u8212- filesystem utilities, path manipulation, and sandbox I/O.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b test_docx} \u8212- DOCX archive extraction, XML parsing, and dialogue extraction.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b test_neurocast_auth} \u8212- authentication-flow testing against Neurocast endpoints.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Requirements\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab REAPER 7.0+\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab ReaImGui (install via ReaPack)\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Platform Support\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Windows x64} \u8212- scripts and modules, plus bundled curl 8.13.0 and 7-Zip 26.00\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b macOS} \u8212- scripts and modules; uses {\f1 /usr/bin/curl} and system {\f1 unzip}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Linux} \u8212- intentionally unsupported; the index exposes no installable sources\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Installation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Add this repository URL to ReaPack: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/Logutin/slava-reaper-reapack-test-curl-jobs-imgui/raw/main/index.xml"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
https://github.com/Logutin/slava-reaper-reapack-test-curl-jobs-imgui/raw/main/index.xml
}}}
\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Install {\b Slava REAPER Test Suite} from the package browser.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Find the four test scripts in REAPER's Actions list under {\f1 Slava-Testing}.\sa180\par}
