. Bundled binaries, generated Unicode data, and the third-party JSON module retain their own terms. See the complete {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/Logutin/slava-reaper-reapack-test-curl-jobs-imgui/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
third-party notices and binary provenance
}}}
.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The applicable license and notice files are installed in the package's {\f1 licenses} subdirectory.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Maintainer Release Workflow\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This repository intentionally has no GitHub Actions yet. Releases are checked locally with the toolchain available on the maintainer's machine.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Change package files and update the metapackage {\f1 @version} and {\f1 @changelog}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab Run {\f1 reapack-index --check --strict --warnings} before committing.\par}
